WEBVTT

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:41.490
Such boorish people.

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:45.570
Pleeease taaake a maaap...

00:01:47.510 --> 00:01:52.070
Maaake sure youuu know the full 
scheduuule for the evennnt, unhhh...

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:54.960
That'll be twenty euros.

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:56.460
Too expensive.

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:58.720
But aaall proceeeeds...

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:05.980
go to the Bellevuuue Catheeedral
 restoraaation fund, unhhh!

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:19.570
<b>The Extravagance of 
Goemon Ishikawa XIII</b>

00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:26.620
Hey, Monsieur Samurai.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:31.220
Sorry, but all prop weapons 
have to be checked.

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:32.880
Is that a sword?

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:40.940
First, I would ask you to look at this.

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:42.910
Whoa, now. Too close.

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:51.240
You owe me a great deal for this, Lupin.

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:55.550
Jigen, the photo.

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:56.600
On it.

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:03.650
Meet Chloé Cazal.

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:08.980
She was close friends with recently 
deceased Belgian millionaire, André Regnie.

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:13.250
As a token of their friendship, 
she was given a special necklace.

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:16.060
It hardly seems valuable.

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:20.270
Open it up and inside, there's a gem 
that'll take your breath away.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:23.510
Sell that and you'd be set up for life.

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:28.000
Apparently, some Russian nobles had it made 
when the Russian Revolution kicked off.

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:32.860
And with that kind of back story, the original 
owners' descendants want it back bad.

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:36.520
So they've hired a real nasty 
bunch to "take care" of Chloé.

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:40.240
And Chloé, realizing she was in hot water,

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:43.780
took the necklace and 
got the hell out of Belgium.

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:51.710
And she is in that city?

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:54.400
That's one of three possibilities.

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:58.780
Her parents used to live in that city. 
They owned an old-timey bistro.

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:03.010
But her best friend 
apparently lives in Geneva.

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:07.140
And in Sicily, there's a hotel 
reservation under her name.

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:10.100
We're playing hide-and-seek with 
Chloé Cazal, in other words.

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:13.430
Allow me to confirm one thing.

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:21.190
This job is not simply an attempt to court 
the affections of some random woman, is it?

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:28.600
Goemon... Please just 
trust me on this one, will ya?

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:32.820
The honor of the Lupin family 
is riding on getting that jewel!

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:40.940
Excuse me! Can we take a picture?

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:43.930
Who's he meant to be cosplaying as?

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:45.100
He's a samurai.

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:47.000
Y'know, the guys who use ninjutsu.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.090
Nuh-uh!

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:52.150
A samurai wields a sword 
and fights with honor!

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:58.840
Hey, can I take a picture with you?

00:04:58.840 --> 00:04:59.880
I refuse.

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:01.120
Stop it! Let go of me!

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.570
Hm, should I?

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:06.680
You have to help Chloé!

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:08.170
Chloé?!

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:12.200
If you ask me, you'd be better off 
just bein' nice to us, girly.

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:15.050
See you soon, sweetheart.

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:21.420
You know Chloé, boy?

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:25.280
Yeah. She moved into our
neighborhood a while back.

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:27.670
She's nice. A really kind person.

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:32.190
But... she seems sorta sad for some reason.

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:37.390
She came by to say hi, and talked 
about how she's only going to use

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:39.360
local ingredients in the bistro.

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:44.780
Mama thinks she's seen more 
than her fair share of trouble.

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:47.160
What kind of trouble do you think she's in?

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:49.810
There are as many kinds of trouble 
as there are kinds of people.

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:51.420
Not prying is an act of mercy.

00:05:52.420 --> 00:05:53.950
Okay! I get what you're saying.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.610
Incidentally, I need a place to lodge.

00:05:56.610 --> 00:05:59.740
No way! Wow, this has gotta be fate!

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:01.080
Right here!

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:04.230
This is my house! It's a bed and breakfast!

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:19.130
You can have this room!

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:27.170
We were changing the decor 
so it'd tie in with the event,

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:30.150
but we didn't finish up the rooms 
on the second floor in time.

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:31.920
It was a huge waste of effort, really.

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:40.750
How much for the room?

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:45.510
Two-hundred euros a night.

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:47.690
Two-hundred for <i>this</i>?!

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:49.410
That's what Mama said...

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:53.610
I am not sure when I will be leaving.

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:55.260
I will pay for an extension if I stay longer.

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:57.490
Wow, you're rich!

00:06:57.490 --> 00:06:59.160
Are you the shogun or something?!

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:03.380
Uh, hey, look.

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.000
If you're gonna hole up in your room,

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:25.880
Mama wants to know if you want 
your meals brought up to you.

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:27.740
If you would, please.

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:28.870
The thing is...

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:31.220
Breakfast's included in 
the price of the room,

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:33.050
but lunch and dinner are separate,

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:35.470
and there's a charge for room service.

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:36.660
So be it.

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:38.400
And, uh...

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:40.700
You have to pay in advance, too.

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:05.930
Their security system's out 'cause 
they couldn't afford the payments.

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:07.610
This'll be a piece of cake, bro.

00:08:07.610 --> 00:08:11.460
I'm not so sure. I hear Lupin's 
motley crew is gunning for it, too.

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:12.930
Okay, it's open.

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:15.250
I wonder where that little madam is...

00:08:17.950 --> 00:08:19.180
Hey! What's wrong?!

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:25.060
Is someone there?

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:33.780
Help! Someone call the police!

00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:43.640
This is going to be a long night.

00:08:53.270 --> 00:08:54.830
Very conspicuous for a shinobi.

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:02.020
Good morning, Goemon.

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:04.510
My name is Chloé Cazal.

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:08.280
Chloé's place never gets any customers.

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:10.940
So I had an idea!

00:09:13.890 --> 00:09:15.020
What is it?

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:19.490
Mr. Samurai, please help me.

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:22.660
Go ahead and take it!

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:32.960
Ready!

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:38.080
Thanks to your presence, 
business is booming today.

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:39.420
I am pleased to hear that.

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:45.040
I am going outside for some fresh air.

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:49.680
Wow, you look really authentic.

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:56.590
This is what we made today.

00:09:56.970 --> 00:10:00.190
I want you to have half, Goemon.

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:02.460
That hardly seems enough.

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:06.450
I-I guess you're right. I'm sorry.

00:10:06.450 --> 00:10:08.490
It was just a samurai joke, Chloé!

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:10.540
It is not in my nature to jest.

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:18.160
If you have money to pay me, you should 
put some toward your security system.

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:21.140
There won't always be 
someone watching out for you.

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:25.640
Does that mean last night's 
good Samaritan... was you?

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:26.770
I know nothing about that.

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:28.730
I turn in early, you see.

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:44.880
You're such a cutie...

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:50.870
'Sup, Goemon! How's it going?

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:52.620
How did you know where I was?

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:55.120
<i>I just phoned around till 
I found out where you were staying.</i>

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:57.740
I gotta tell you, buddy, 
this place is a dead end.

00:10:57.740 --> 00:11:00.500
Nothing but tourists, and I've got 
squat to show for my endeavors.

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:02.540
I was wondering how things 
were going on your end.

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:06.610
<i>Presumptuous tourists have me
 at my wits' end, as well.</i>

00:11:05.670 --> 00:11:07.280
Shhh, quiet.

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:09.410
<i>I have to wonder why you 
chose a time like this to—</i>

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:11.020
You can do it, Goemon!

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:13.900
<i>I just </i>know <i>you can score
 that necklace for me!</i>

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:15.990
So this <i>was</i> for a woman...

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:17.490
<i>You've got it all wrong, Goemon—</i>

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:31.940
Does no one sleep at night?

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:50.930
<i>Who could have done this?</i>

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:16.640
This is Chloé?

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:19.100
Look out!

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:31.600
<i>The grape man?</i>

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:37.550
<i>He knows what he is doing.</i>

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:40.990
Run, samurai...

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:44.960
I do not leave debts unpaid.

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:53.990
Are you related to Chloé?

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:57.970
Nah, I work for Sirena Security.

00:12:57.970 --> 00:13:00.090
You've seen the stickers 
all over town, right?

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:02.260
The bistro is part of my beat.

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:05.130
Oh, and my name's Bruno. 
Nice to meet you.

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:07.610
Your devotion goes beyond 
simply being professional.

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:11.820
When you get a bunch of thugs 
stomping around the place,

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:15.060
pretending to be tourists, 
and all targeting the same woman...

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:16.770
Well, you get curious.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.950
Do you know this woman?

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:27.340
Ow, ow, ow!

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:29.570
Ow, that really hurts...

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:34.550
It's Chloé Cazal, right?

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:37.260
I think she lives somewhere in Belgium.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:40.590
I last ran into her about three years ago.

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:43.430
She didn't renew her contract
because she couldn't afford our services.

00:13:43.430 --> 00:13:45.340
Then, the woman in the bistro...

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:48.760
That's the real question here.

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:51.980
To be honest, I was hoping 
you'd fill me in on who she is.

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:54.820
She calls herself Chloé Cazal.

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:56.230
Seems that way.

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:59.650
But the locals have lived 
here for a long time.

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:01.770
Anyone would see 
through a lie that obvious.

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:04.430
Well, unless you're from out of town, of course.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:09.380
Anyway, what's-your-name... I require rest...

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:12.400
Can you watch over her in the meantime?

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:14.900
Sure. But I'm a professional.

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:15.930
Which means...

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:19.420
What do you think that'll get you?

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:22.960
Think about who you're up against. 
You get what you pay for, pal.

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:28.520
Money is no object.

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:29.640
Huh.

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:33.460
What's your relationship 
with this girl, anyway?

00:14:33.460 --> 00:14:34.540
I am unsure.

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:37.650
Perhaps, we are simply ships, passing in the...

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:40.380
She... helped...

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:43.010
A crane? No... it was a turtle...

00:14:43.970 --> 00:14:46.320
Huh? Fine, just go get some sleep.

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:49.620
Hey, Goemon, you there?

00:14:51.480 --> 00:14:56.100
Chloé wants to have dinner with us!
 She says she's got good news!

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:58.550
Understood. I will be down shortly.

00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:17.340
Do you like it?

00:15:17.340 --> 00:15:18.140
Indeed.

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:25.770
The wine and the ingredients for 
this meal were all sourced locally.

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:28.270
I want everything we sell to be local.

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:30.880
Even though you can't afford electricity?

00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:32.780
Well, the thing is...

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:35.840
I think everything's on 
the verge of coming good.

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:40.300
Maybe after all the trouble I've been 
through, God's finally on my side.

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:44.030
This "god" you speak of... 
Is it André Regnie?

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:00.520
<i>Have I not slept enough?</i>

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:06.020
<i>It's Sicilian?</i>

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:09.900
Chloe... this wine... where...

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.880
Mr. Bruno gave it to me.

00:16:12.390 --> 00:16:16.270
He said he was a... friend of...

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:18.320
Chloé?! What's wrong?

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:21.410
Jean... Get help... The police...

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:22.660
Okay, I will!

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:36.350
I showed up because you were 
acting a little weird, but...

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:38.010
Goemon, you sly dog!

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:40.200
I'm impressed.

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:46.600
Hey, watch it!

00:16:51.180 --> 00:16:53.360
Fine! We'll take it by force!

00:16:58.250 --> 00:16:59.780
Rise and shine, Goemon.

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:01.340
I've got the loot.

00:17:01.340 --> 00:17:03.120
Time to clear out.

00:17:06.430 --> 00:17:08.670
I will not let you take the necklace...

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:12.600
Sorry about this!

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:17.380
Well, hello, there!

00:17:17.380 --> 00:17:19.010
I-It's Lupin!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:20.380
He's got the necklace! After him!

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:28.430
Get a car!

00:17:41.270 --> 00:17:42.340
Awaken!

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:57.340
Holy crap, is that Lupin III?!

00:17:58.600 --> 00:17:59.600
For real?

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.500
Are you a friend of his?

00:18:02.500 --> 00:18:06.090
He and I seem to have differing views 
on what constitutes a friendship.

00:18:07.240 --> 00:18:09.720
Now, Bruno, stop Lupin!

00:18:10.590 --> 00:18:11.720
You sure?

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:13.350
Dead or alive?

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:14.970
I have no preference.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.310
Press it yourself.

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:27.120
<b>Fire!</b>

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:27.120
It's ready when you are.

00:18:27.740 --> 00:18:29.980
This does not require a blade, nor honor.

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:31.120
Click.

00:18:39.660 --> 00:18:41.650
Aw, gimme a break!

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:04.270
I surrender...

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:09.080
Y'know, it looks convincing, 
but it's a fake.

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:10.110
What?

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:11.940
When did you notice?

00:19:11.940 --> 00:19:14.840
At the bistro when I took it.

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:17.490
Then, why take it at all?!

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:22.110
I figured you two might 
want some alone time!

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:26.350
And who's this picture of?

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:29.350
Oh, her? That's Chloé 
when she was younger.

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:32.120
Thought it might help motivate you!

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:33.370
I am going to cut you.

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:38.040
Cut! Cut! Cut! And cut!

00:19:35.490 --> 00:19:36.430
Stop that!

00:19:36.430 --> 00:19:37.360
Easy now!

00:19:40.980 --> 00:19:42.670
They really <i>are</i> friends.

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:48.110
I'm sorry. My real name is Inés Cazal...

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:53.880
I didn't mean to trick you. But...

00:19:56.520 --> 00:19:58.870
What do you think of this valuation?

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:04.400
Hey, Lupin. I found her.

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:07.400
She's celebrating without 
a care in the world.

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:11.920
The people who wanted the necklace back 
were looking everywhere for Mama.

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:15.280
I wanted to make sure she 
could forget all her troubles...

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:17.170
while enjoying a much-needed vacation.

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:21.170
In other words, I guess 
you could say I was bait.

00:20:27.570 --> 00:20:28.650
Goemon?

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:32.900
Uh, Mama gave me this 
invoice for you to look at.

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.490
Because you let other people stay in
 that other room without asking...

00:20:37.850 --> 00:20:39.290
That's against the rules, y'know?

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:46.820
Chloé... Or rather, Inés... 
Would it be possible to work in your bistro?

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:49.920
I cannot afford this.

00:22:15.610 --> 00:22:18.680
The Padar Kingdom's greatest treasure, 
the Bloody Teardrop...

00:22:18.680 --> 00:22:23.220
Turns out, the princess who has it 
is attending a school here in France!

00:22:23.220 --> 00:22:25.630
And she's classmates with Amy!

00:22:25.630 --> 00:22:28.060
Seems like she's a real oddball,

00:22:28.060 --> 00:22:30.140
but when it comes to weirdness, 
Amy takes some beating.

00:22:30.140 --> 00:22:34.030
Looks like they're getting along well, which 
makes Uncle Lupin feel all fuzzy inside!

00:22:34.030 --> 00:22:35.970
All right, since I'm here, anyway,

00:22:35.970 --> 00:22:37.920
I might as well check this school out!

00:22:37.920 --> 00:22:40.460
Next time: The Bow, 
The Princess, and the Terrorist.

00:22:37.920 --> 00:22:44.920
<b>The Bow, The Princess, and the Terrorist</b>

00:22:40.460 --> 00:22:44.290
Time to infiltrate an all-girls' school. 
Gotta make sure I look sharper than usual!
